1
00:00:00,786 --> 00:00:02,186
(Caption:)I know.

2
00:00:02,187 --> 00:00:05,387
(Howard:)We've been waiting so long
for this.

3
00:00:05,391 --> 00:00:09,561
(Raj:)And we've built it up
in our heads so much.

4
00:00:09,561 --> 00:00:12,501
(Wil:)Guys, it's
just a movie.

5
00:00:12,498 --> 00:00:13,998
(Leonard:)That's true.

6
00:00:13,999 --> 00:00:15,669
(Howard:)He's right.
It is.

7
00:00:15,668 --> 00:00:19,808
(Wil:)Although, we all
remember Jar Jar.

8
00:00:19,805 --> 00:00:23,405
(Caption:)Leonard,
I-I'm scared again.

9
00:00:28,947 --> 00:00:33,017
(Sheldon:)Well, I enjoyed that
more than I thought I would.

10
00:00:39,825 --> 00:00:43,095
(Leonard:)Me, too.

11
00:00:43,095 --> 00:00:48,295
(Sheldon:)I look forward to your next
birthday when we do it again.

12
00:00:49,735 --> 00:00:52,005
(Amy:)That works for me.

13
00:00:52,004 --> 00:00:55,644
(Sheldon:)I enjoyed that
more than I thought I would.

14
00:00:58,444 --> 00:01:07,024
(Raj:)I don't think
I can walk right now.

